{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08049","headline":"司马将军歌 · 李白","name":"司马将军歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狂风吹古月，窃弄章华台。\n北落明星动光彩，南征猛将如云雷。\n手中电击倚天劒，直斩长鲸海水开。\n我见楼船壮心目，颇似龙骧下三蜀。\n扬兵习战张虎旗，江中白浪如银屋。\n身居玉帐临河魁，紫髯若戟冠崔嵬。\n细柳开营揖天子，始知灞上爲婴孩。\n羌笛横吹阿嚲回，向月楼中吹落梅。\n将军自起舞长劒，壮士呼声动九垓。\n功成献凯见明主，丹青画象麒麟台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}